"How RoomScope talks to your interface: WASAPI, ASIO, WDM-KS, DirectSound"
" or MME on Windows, Core Audio on macOS, ALSA or JACK on Linux. Input an"
"d output must use the same one. \"System default\" uses the devices your s"
"ystem uses; a star marks the entry recommended for each device."
