msgstr "主題"

msgid "Compare two sessions"
msgstr "比較两個會話"

msgid ""
"Every difference carries a validity: RoomScope says when two takes canno"
"t be compared rather than printing a delta."
msgstr "每個差值都帶有有效性：两次測量無法比較時，RoomScope 會明確說明，而不是給出一個差值。"

