msgstr "同時詢問每個設備接受哪些采樣率（不會播放任何聲音）"

msgid ""
"Paste this report into a GitHub issue so the problem can be reproduced. "
"Nothing is sent automatically. Probing asks each device which sample rat"
"es it accepts; nothing is played. Device names can contain personal name"
"s: review the text before posting."
msgstr ""
"把這份報告粘貼到 GitHub Issue 中，以便復現問題。RoomScope 不會自動發送任何內容。探測會詢問每個設備接受哪些采樣率，不會播"
"放任何聲音。設備名稱可能包含個人姓名，發布前請檢查文本。"

msgid "The log file and settings are in this folder."
