msgid ""
"Nothing has been entered. This picture shows where the two tape measures"
" go. It is not your room, and no wall is drawn."
msgstr "還沒有填入資料。這張圖說明两根卷尺量的是哪裡。它不是你的房間，也沒有畫牆。"

msgid ""
"The ring is every loudspeaker position this measurement allows. The cabi"
"net is one of them, drawn so the direct path can be seen. No wall is dra"
"wn."
msgstr "這個環是本次測量允許的每一個揚聲器位置。箱子是其中之一，畫出來是為了看見直達聲。沒有畫牆。"

msgid ""
"The line is the loudspeaker distance you entered, and the stand is the m"
"icrophone height you entered. The loudspeaker is drawn at that same heig"
"ht only so the tape can be seen; its real height comes from a measuremen"
"t. No room and no wall are drawn."
msgstr ""
"這條線是你填入的揚聲器距離，立桿是你填入的話筒高度。揚聲器畫在同一高度，只是為了看見這根卷尺；它的真實高度要等測量之後才知道。沒有畫房間，也沒有"
"畫牆。"

msgid ""
"The line is the loudspeaker distance you entered. Both heights in this p"
"icture are an example. No room and no wall are drawn."
msgstr "這條線是你填入的揚聲器距離。圖中两個高度都只是示例。沒有畫房間，也沒有畫牆。"

msgid "reference plane"
msgstr "參考平面"

msgid "Loudspeaker"
msgstr "揚聲器"

msgid "Placement picture. Drag to rotate."
msgstr "擺放示意。拖動可旋轉。"

msgid "Measured geometry. Drag to rotate."
msgstr "測得的幾何。拖動可旋轉。"

msgid "possible positions"
msgstr "可能的位置"

msgid "Clarity"
msgstr "清晰度"

msgid "Early and late energy"
msgstr "早期與後期能量"

msgid "ratios from the same truncation as the decay; not a room score"
msgstr "與衰減使用同一次噪聲截斷的比值；不是房間評分"

msgid ""
"C50 is early energy over late energy at 50 ms (speech). C80 is the same "
"at 80 ms (music). D50 is the share of energy in the first 50 ms. Centre "
"time is the energy-weighted average time. Time zero is the detected dire"
"ct sound. A ratio is reported only when the decay range is at least 20 d"
"B, and it is not a room score."
msgstr ""
"C50 是 50 ms 處的早期能量除以後期能量（語言）。C80 是 80 ms 處的同一比值（音樂）。D50 是前 50 ms 能量占總能量的"
"份額。重心時間是按能量加權的平均時間。時間零點是測得的直達聲。只有衰減范圍至少有 20 dB 時才給出比值，而且它不是房間評分。"

msgid "Centre time"
msgstr "重心時間"

msgid "EARLY AND LATE ENERGY"
msgstr "早期與後期能量"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"Insufficient decay range for an early/late energy ratio: {available:.1f}"
" dB available, {needed:.0f} dB needed"
msgstr "早期/後期能量比的衰減范圍不够：現有 {available:.1f} dB，需要 {needed:.0f} dB"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"the noise truncation ({truncation_s:.3f} s) is not after the {split_ms:."
"0f} ms early window, so the late energy is not measured"
msgstr "噪聲截斷點（{truncation_s:.3f} s）不在 {split_ms:.0f} ms 早期窗之後，因此沒有測到後期能量"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{metric} {value:.1f} dB vs {other:.1f} dB"
msgstr "{metric} {value:.1f} dB，對比 {other:.1f} dB"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "the response is too short for a centre time"
msgstr "響應太短，無法計算重心時間"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{metric} {value:.1f} % vs {other:.1f} %"
msgstr "{metric} {value:.1f} %，對比 {other:.1f} %"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "{metric} {seconds:.3f} s vs {other:.3f} s"
msgstr "{metric} {seconds:.3f} s，對比 {other:.3f} s"

msgid ""
"Early sound is not clearly ahead of the later room sound (C50 {value:.1f"
"} dB, below {threshold:.0f} dB). For close-miked recording this can blur"
" the source; move the microphone closer or add absorption, then measure "
"again. This is one position, not a room grade."
msgstr ""
"早期聲沒有明顯壓過後面的房間聲（C50 {value:.1f} dB，低於 {threshold:.0f} dB）。近距離拾音時聲源可能發糊；把"
"話筒移近，或增加吸聲後再測一次。這是一個位置的結果，不是房間評分。"

msgid ""
"Late room sound is weak (C80 {value:.1f} dB, above {threshold:.0f} dB). "
"This is one position, not a room grade."
msgstr "後期房間聲偏少（C80 {value:.1f} dB，高於 {threshold:.0f} dB）。這是一個位置的結果，不是房間評分。"

msgid ""
"Speech clarity is low for close vocals (C50 {value:.1f} dB, below {thres"
"hold:.0f} dB). Diction may blur between words; move the microphone close"
"r or add absorption. This is one position, not a room grade."
msgstr ""
"對人聲近距離拾音來說，語言清晰度偏低（C50 {value:.1f} dB，低於 {threshold:.0f} dB）。字與字之間可能發糊；把"
"話筒移近，或增加吸聲。這是一個位置的結果，不是房間評分。"

msgid ""
"Speech clarity is low for voice-over (C50 {value:.1f} dB, below {thresho"
"ld:.0f} dB). Narration usually wants the first 50 ms to hold more of the"
" energy; move the microphone closer or add absorption. This is one posit"
"ion, not a room grade."
msgstr ""
"對旁白來說，語言清晰度偏低（C50 {value:.1f} dB，低於 {threshold:.0f} dB）。旁白通常希望前 50 毫秒占更多"
"能量；把話筒移近，或增加吸聲。這是一個位置的結果，不是房間評分。"

msgid ""
"Musical clarity is low for acoustic guitar (C80 {value:.1f} dB, below {t"
"hreshold:.0f} dB). The note may sit in the room rather than in the instr"
"ument; move the microphone closer or add absorption. This is one positio"
"n, not a room grade."
msgstr ""
"對原聲吉他來說，音樂清晰度偏低（C80 {value:.1f} dB，低於 {threshold:.0f} dB）。音符可能落在房間裡而不是樂器"
"上；把話筒移近，或增加吸聲。這是一個位置的結果，不是房間評分。"

msgid ""
"Late room sound is weak for a room microphone (C80 {value:.1f} dB, above"
" {threshold:.0f} dB). A room microphone usually wants more of the room a"
"fter 80 ms; move it farther from the source or into a livelier part of t"
"he room. This is one position, not a room grade."
msgstr ""
"作為房間話筒，後期房間聲偏少（C80 {value:.1f} dB，高於 {threshold:.0f} dB）。房間話筒通常希望 80 毫秒之"
"後還有更多房間聲；把話筒移離聲源，或換到更活的位置。這是一個位置的結果，不是房間評分。"

msgid ""
"Speech clarity is low for an ensemble (C50 {value:.1f} dB, below {thresh"
"old:.0f} dB). Some late sound suits a choir, but this much will blur dic"
"tion. This is one position, not a room grade."
msgstr ""
"對合唱來說，語言清晰度偏低（C50 {value:.1f} dB，低於 {threshold:.0f} dB）。合奏可以保留一些後期聲，但到這個"
"程度吐字會糊。這是一個位置的結果，不是房間評分。"

